(AO)^2 &= (AB)^2\\
\Rightarrow\qquad (r + \sqrt{6})^2 &= (2r)^2\end{align*} which gives $r = \boxed{\frac{2\sqrt{6}}{3}}$. </think> <answer> \frac{2\sqrt{6}}{3} </answer>

